Bundled third-party components
------------------------------
The distributed, minified bundle (model-viewer.min.js) statically embeds several
third-party libraries. Their licences (identified by the SPDX headers inside the
bundle) are:

  three.js               MIT Licence            (c) 2010-2024 three.js authors
  lit / lit-html / lit-element
                         BSD-3-Clause Licence   (c) 2017 Google LLC

The full text of the MIT and BSD-3-Clause licences is available from each
project's repository; both are permissive and compatible with redistribution of
the minified bundle as shipped here.

Runtime note (external decoder fetches)
---------------------------------------
For UNCOMPRESSED .glb models the bundle makes no external network requests. If a
model uses Draco geometry compression or KTX2 (Basis) textures, model-viewer
lazily fetches the matching decoder at runtime from Google's static host:

  Draco decoder   https://www.gstatic.com/draco/versioned/decoders/1.5.6/
  KTX2 / Basis    https://www.gstatic.com/basis-universal/versioned/2021-04-15-ba1c3e4/

To keep a page fully self-hosted, ship uncompressed .glb assets, or self-host the
decoders and point model-viewer at them. See README.md for guidance.
